<title>BELGIUM: Belgian company investment fell 3.3 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Belgian company investment fell 3.3 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's National Statistics Office released the following data on corporate investment, calculated from VAT returns, for March -</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     March 97   Feb 97    March 96</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1985)  197.4	150.3     204.1</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	-3.3	 +2.0</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT   Jan-March 97     Jan-March 96</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	+1.2		  +7.1</p>
<p>NOTE - non-industrial investments rose 5.7 percent in the first three months, industrial investments fell 5.4 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
